{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793509680450169001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"balladic-fattening-tortoise","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":2},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793506206011741001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"fb2ef6c4-7624-4dc4-9b13-9ea3b0cddc7a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"bd7a-57a6-34db-4f1b"}],"description":"## Observation\nOn the operator's macOS host, the system temp dir (`tempfile.gettempdir()`, /var/folders/.../T) holds 575 `rebar-opcert-*` directories, each with an `opcert-key` file that begins `-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----` (256 also hold `opcert-key.pub`). Modification dates: 144 on 2026-10-28, 135 on 10-29, 144 on 10-30, 153 on 10-31 (measured 2026-10-31).\n\n`rebar.opcert_service.keyprov.compose_signer` creates exactly this shape (`tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"rebar-opcert-\")` + `opcert-key` copy) and only `OpcertSigner.cleanup()` removes it.\n\n## Unverified (next checks)\nWhich caller leaks them is not established. Callers that construct a signer: 6 unit-test modules (test_opcert_service*.py, test_rp04_s6_opcert_startup.py, test_mcp_opcert_signing_goose.py, test_opcert_privkey_env_pop_932d.py) and `mcp_server.compose_startup_opcert_binding`. Next check: run each of those modules alone and count new `rebar-opcert-*` dirs before and after.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The leaking caller(s) identified by a before/after count.\n- [ ] Running the unit suite leaves no new `rebar-opcert-*` directory in the system temp dir (regression test).\n- [ ] Existing leaked copies are removed by the operator (not by tooling) after the fix lands.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["security","opcert","tests"],"ticket_id":"89d1-eb1f-aa57-49a6","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Signer key copies leak into the host temp dir (~140 rebar-opcert-* private keys per day)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ad033496-7a25-49d7-a9b1-d75e3005fefd","fb2ef6c4-7624-4dc4-9b13-9ea3b0cddc7a"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793509680450169001,"uuid":"aaee58a8-39b2-4f94-83ab-d3da2b4e8759"}